<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines raises o/n lending rate to 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippines raises o/n lending rate to 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank said on Tuesday it had raised its overnight lending rate to 15 percent from 13 percent.</p>
<p>It said it had left its borrowing rate unchanged at 11 percent. The bank gave no explanation for the change.</p>
</text>
